sections.text:
To optimally clear Mercenary Camps as Hogger with the aforementioned settings:
choose the Hogg Wild path you intend to use;
if the path is diagonal, use your Camera Turn hotkeys to make it horizontal or vertical;
send Hogger to the starting position and do not move your mouse cursor;
use the arrow keys to slightly move your camera in the direction
you want to cast Hogg Wild;
if the path is horizontal or vertical, cast Loot Hoard on the desired path to bounce on it;
if the path is diagonal, cast Loot Hoard for damage only and press the [D] key to cancel it;
use the arrow keys to further move your camera in the direction
you want to cast Hogg Wild;
cast Hogg Wild;
press the [Space] key to reset your camera position to where Hogger currently is;
when Loot Hoard expires, press the [E] key again to cancel Hogg Wild and stop bouncing;
spread your Basic Attacks so that all Mercenaries have about the same Health remaining;
finish them off with Ez-Thro Dynamite and Staggering Blow.
You can also use the [Shift] modifier to queue up Hogg Wild while Hogger
is still moving to the starting position, so that he will immediately cast it once there.
